        <activityName xml:lang="en">Case, for tablet, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Case, for tablet, at plant
The data set represents the production of tablet with defined technical specifications; UUID: e80d1580-f99a-308d-aa64-42441640f786
The dataset for tablet case is modeled as polyurethane plastic materials. The packaging and assembly efforts are included, as well energy for shaping the materials. The case is suitable for a 10.9 inch tablet devices.
Location: Data for global average for tablets
Technology: The case is made of polyurethane materials.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e80d1580-f99a-308d-aa64-42441640f786.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
